197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (Manual transcription, summarization, note-taking, and identification of important moments are time-consuming and require considerable human effort. Users may also find it difficult to locate a particular topic or important section quickly.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (Therefore, there is a need for an intelligent platform that can automatically process video content, generate transcripts and summaries, identify important moments, and present the extracted information in an easy-to-use interface.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
