/T (The purpose of system testing is to identify errors and ensure that the ClipMind AI system functions correctly. Testing is the process of executing the software to verify that it meets the specified requirements and user expectations without failures. The system is tested at various levels to ensure reliability, accuracy, and performance in handling video uploads, transcription, summarization, key moment detection, user management, and analytics.)
/E (The purpose of system testing is to identify errors and ensure that the ClipMind AI system functions correctly. Testing is the process of executing the software to verify that it meets the specified requirements and user expectations without failures. The system is tested at various levels to ensure reliability, accuracy, and performance in handling video uploads, transcription, summarization, key moment detection, user management, and analytics.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
